{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台式鹹酥雞竟然能結合珍珠奶茶？！台灣炸雞品牌繼光香香雞推出限定「黑糖珍奶風味shakeshake粉」！將濃郁的黑糖甜香與奶茶風韻完美調和，灑入剛出爐、酥脆多汁的招牌香香雞或黃金薯條中用力搖勻，讓每一塊熱騰騰的炸雞都裹上一層誘人的鹹甜香氣。網民試過話覺得鹹鹹甜甜口味配搭炸雞，味道非常神奇！雖然聽起來像「黑暗料理」，但大家有沒有興趣試試呢？</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499523984533054_21444621056a64dda83a320.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499524169449360_14966539106a64ddaa5d6f7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499524360444025_7423324666a64ddac618f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499524581835209_13529188756a64ddae30cb4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499524752321382_7788827666a64ddb0548ed.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178499524990041439_5726367326a64ddb257be1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T16:18:13.428658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}